  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> are coplanar&nbsp;</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#956;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>And given projection of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>54</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>54</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>24</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>54</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>54</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>24</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>By solving equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p>"
